# Uploads Directory

This directory stores user-uploaded files (images, documents, etc.)

## Structure

- `products/` - Product images
- `banners/` - Marketing banner images
- `categories/` - Category images
- `general/` - Other uploaded files

## Important Notes

- Files are automatically organized by type
- Filenames include timestamps to prevent collisions
- Images are automatically compressed to WebP format
- This directory is ignored by git (see .gitignore)

## Production

In production (Docker), files are stored in `/var/www/uploads` and served by nginx with caching headers.
